<title>USA: Lone Star Steak Q2 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Lone Star Steak Q2 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA, Kan. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve weeks ended</p>
<p>			 June 17 1997	     June 11 1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.45		    $0.21</p>
<p> Net			 18,546		    8,103</p>
<p> Revs		     133,360		  107,768</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  41,556		   39,410</p>
<p>			     Six months</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.88		    $0.54</p>
<p> Net			 36,750		   21,040</p>
<p> Revs		     263,615		  214,144</p>
<p> Avg			 41,565		   39,123</p>
<p>	     All data in 000s except per share numbers</p>
<p>NOTES: The company said its 1996 numbers include an after-tax write-off of its European joint venture of $5.96 million, or $0.15 a share.</p>
<p>Comparable store sales declined 6.4 percent in the second quarter. Year-to-date comparable sales fell 5.7 percent.</p>
<p>Full name is Lone Star Steakhouse &amp; Saloon Inc.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
